Introduction to the Open Software Foundation's Technologies
An Inside View of the IBM/OSF Products
Technologies in OSF Distributed Computing Environment (DCE)
IBM AIX DCE for the RISC System/6000
User Experience with the AIX DCE Product
DCE - Distributed Computing Environment Part 1 of 3
DCE - Distributed Computing Environment Part 2 of 3
DCE - Distributed Computing Environment Part 3 of 3
Writing DCE/RPC Client-Server Applications
Distributed System Security (OS/2 and AIX Perspective)
Hands on Programming with DCE

I am now planning the program for the next SHARE conference in Anaheim,
California in February.

